1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,949
This is me. Leo. Sixteen.

2
00:00:01,949 --> 00:00:05,280
And this is my graphics card. It's older than me.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:10,583
So I made Mom a presentation: why our family needs a new GPU.

4
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:12,788
Not for me. For the family.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,035
Christmas morning. It worked.

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:21,120
And I kept my promise. ComfyUI, Stillive, one click.

7
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:24,660
Mom scanned a QR code, and that was it.

8
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:27,745
No account. No cloud. Just our PC.

9
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:33,004
On her phone, two doors: bring a memory back to life, or step into one.

10
00:00:33,004 --> 00:00:35,088
Pick a photo. Tap. That's it.

11
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:39,297
Summer 2005. My great-grandparents, before I was born.

12
00:00:39,297 --> 00:00:41,269
Mom tapped: "Surprise me."

13
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,563
My great-grandparents' wedding, 1952.

14
00:00:46,563 --> 00:00:49,209
Back in color. Back in motion.

15
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:52,993
Now, the magic trick: change era.

16
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:56,095
My cousin's 25th. One tap: pirates.

17
00:00:56,095 --> 00:01:00,148
Same faces. Same smiles. Three centuries earlier.

18
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:01,815
Or teleport them.

19
00:01:01,815 --> 00:01:04,372
Same family, under the northern lights.

20
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:08,048
No idea fits? Write your own.

21
00:01:08,048 --> 00:01:11,529
Anything you imagine, Stillive animates it.

22
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:15,240
Dad's camping trip, '85. Dad's the kid with the headphones.

23
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,737
Dad imagined... a lion.

24
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:19,937
Thanks, Dad.

25
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:23,182
Then Mom found the second door. One selfie...

26
00:01:23,182 --> 00:01:25,964
and she walked into her own bedroom. 1994.

27
00:01:25,964 --> 00:01:28,747
And hugged the little girl she used to be.

28
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:30,975
Okay. I cried a little.

29
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:35,966
How does it work? Gemma 4 looks at the photo and writes the scene.

30
00:01:35,966 --> 00:01:39,071
MiniMax H3 turns it into video, with sound.

31
00:01:39,071 --> 00:01:42,466
All inside ComfyUI, on our own PC. Open source.

32
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,835
And my new graphics card?

33
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:50,113
Booked. Until next Christmas.

